{
  "sn12.55:0.1": "Linked Discourses 12.55 ",
  "sn12.55:0.2": "6. Suffering ",
  "sn12.55:0.3": "A Great Tree ",
  "sn12.55:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn12.55:1.2": "“There are things that fuel grasping. When you concentrate on the gratification provided by these things, your craving grows. ",
  "sn12.55:1.3": "Craving is a requirement for grasping. ",
  "sn12.55:1.4": "Grasping is a requirement for continued existence. … ",
  "sn12.55:1.5": "That is how this entire mass of suffering originates. ",
  "sn12.55:2.1": "Suppose there was a great tree. ",
  "sn12.55:2.2": "And its roots going downwards and across all draw the sap upwards. ",
  "sn12.55:2.3": "Fed and fuelled by that, the great tree would stand for a long time. ",
  "sn12.55:2.4": "In the same way, there are things that fuel grasping. When you concentrate on the gratification provided by these things, your craving grows. ",
  "sn12.55:2.5": "Craving is a requirement for grasping. … ",
  "sn12.55:2.6": "That is how this entire mass of suffering originates. ",
  "sn12.55:3.1": "There are things that fuel grasping. When you concentrate on the drawbacks of these things, your craving ceases. ",
  "sn12.55:3.2": "When craving ceases, grasping ceases. ",
  "sn12.55:3.3": "When grasping ceases, continued existence ceases. … ",
  "sn12.55:3.4": "That is how this entire mass of suffering ceases. ",
  "sn12.55:4.1": "Suppose there was a great tree. ",
  "sn12.55:4.2": "Then a person comes along with a spade and basket. ",
  "sn12.55:4.3": "They’d c